        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "End of terrace three bedroom house.\r\nWest facing garden to the rear.\r\nCentrally located within walking distance of amenities in Leixlip town centre.\r\nConvenient to Maynooth, Celbridge and west Dublin via the M4.\r\nWithin walking distance of Leixlip Confey train station with a frequent commuter train to Dublin City and beyond.\r\nExtending to approximately 77 sq. m (828 sq. ft).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides an end of terrace three bedroom house with a garden to the rear. The property is arranged over ground and one upper floor beneath a pitched roof. This property offers off street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately 77 sq. m (828 sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant Possession."
